  "description": "Oh Ga-eun goes to a job interview, hoping to finally escape unemployment. But… she sat in the wrong seat. \n\n“Ms. Yoon Hye-jin, right?” \n\n“I’m Oh Ga-eun…?” \n\nIt wasn’t a company interview. It was an interview to become someone’s bride. The man in front of her is Joo Seok-jin, the president of Jushin Retail— a man who’s currently “recruiting” a wife. \n\n“Today’s interview to find my wife is a secret.” \n\nShe promises to keep it confidential and leaves— only to run into him again at a vacation spot she spent all her savings to visit. Then a headline suddenly breaks: \n\n[Chairman Joo Seok-jin to Marry This September] \n\n“What do you think about becoming my bride, Ms. Oh Ga-eun?” \n\n“Fine. But don’t you dare cut my salary or allowances.” \n\nAnd just like that, their contract marriage begins. \n\nPosition: Fake wife \nJob: Daughter-in-law of a chaebol family \nAdditional duty: Surviving the in-laws.\n\n She was only supposed to act like the troublesome third daughter-in-law— so why does the way that man looks at her feel so sincere? A contract marriage that started with a mistaken interview seat. It began as something fake… but can their feelings stay fake too?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68752835), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC%EC%9D%80-%EB%A9%B4%EC%A0%91%EB%B6%80%ED%84%B0/4795)",
